  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So there's a lot of fear and worry about the \"cloning\" feature with people thinking based on name that it means any public avatar with the feature on it can be copied directly into another user's personal avatars. As far as I can tell that's not the case.\n\nI move that it be renamed to \"Mobile Pedestal\" or something like that since as far as I can tell that's essentially what it is, the ability to turn people using the avatar into a pedestal for the avatar essentially.",
